SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Cancellation of Certificate of Title for Tiny
  Home and Manufactured Home
DESCRIPTION:Important Information Regarding Cancellation of Certificate of
  Title:\nPursuant to\nTitle 29-A\, section §669\n\, beginning on July 29\
 , 2026\, residents of the state of Maine are able to request cancellation 
 of their Certificate of Title for Tiny Home or Manufactured Home for purpo
 ses of obtaining residential real property.\nWhen a Tiny Home or Manufactu
 red Home is\npermanently affixed to land that you own\, or land where you 
 have permission from the land owner via a signed sworn statement\n\, you m
 ay request to cancel the Certificate of Title. Once the Certificate of Tit
 le is cancelled\, the home becomes part of the residential real property i
 nstead of being treated as personal property. Under Maine law\, this proce
 ss is handled through the county Registry of Deeds and the Maine Secretary
  of State Bureau of Motor Vehicles.\nHow to Cancel your Certificate of Tit
 tle for Tiny Home or Manufactured Home\nBefore requesting cancellation of 
 the title\, make sure:\nYou own the Tiny Home or Manufactured Home\nand\nt
 he land where it is located\;\nand/or\nThe individual that owns the proper
 ty has given a sworn signed statement of authorization.\nThe home has been
 \npermanently affixed\nto the property in accordance with Maine law.\nAny 
 existing liens have been released or the lienholder has agreed to release 
 the lien upon cancellation of the title.\nThis process is not for double-w
 ide mobile homes/trailers\n1. Gather the required documentation\nYou will 
 need to obtain the following documents before submitting your request:\nTh
 e Original Certificate of Title\nA description of the home\, including\;\n
 Model Year\nManufacturer {make}\nWidth\nLength\nIdentification Number/Seri
 al Number\nLien Release Documentation\,\nif applicable\nThe legal descript
 ion of the real property\nA sworn statement confirming:\nYou own both the 
 land\, and the Tiny Home or Manufactured Home\, or a sworn statement from 
 the property land owner\nThe home is permanently affixed to the property/g
 round\nIf you are unable to locate your current Certificate of T\nhttps://
 www.maine.gov/sos/bmv/vehicles/titles/tiny-and-manufactured-homes-conversi
 on-to-real-property
URL:https://www.maine.gov/sos/bmv/vehicles/titles/tiny-and-manufactured-ho
 mes-conversion-to-real-property
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
